<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN MASTERS FINAL ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN MASTERS FINAL ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>PORT EDWARD, South Africa 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading final</p>
<p>round scores in the 750,000 rand ($160,000) South African</p>
<p>Masters golf tournament at San Lameer Country Club on Sunday</p>
<p>(South African unless stated):</p>
<p>276 Mark McNulty (Zimbabwe) 71 68 70 67</p>
<p>280 Adilson da Silva (Brazil) 67 71 72 70</p>
<p>286 Deane Pappas 73 72 69 72, Bruce Vaughan (U.S.)</p>
<p>74 75 67 70</p>
<p>287 Van Phillips (Britain) 71 74 73 69, Gavin Levenson</p>
<p>72 70 77 68</p>
<p>288 Retief Goosen 73 72 74 69</p>
<p>289 Sean Pappas 72 70 74 73, Mark Wiltshire 72 71 74 72,</p>
<p>Ronnie McCann (U.S.) 79 70 69 71</p>
<p>290 Graeme van der Nest 75 69 74 72</p>
</text>
